# Packages
#
# Changed vs. Steph's original 1-deg set-up (data.pkg): useKPP replaced
# by useGGL90 (matches ECCOv4r6's own mixing scheme; see
# code_offline_ggl90/ for the pkg/offline patch this requires).
# packages.conf gains exch2 (LLC90 tile connectivity), but there is
# deliberately NO useEXCH2 line here: checked the real
# model/src/packages_boot.F NAMELIST /PACKAGES/ declaration and
# confirmed useEXCH2 does not exist as a runtime flag at all --
# EXCH2 activates purely from being present in packages.conf
# (the ALLOW_EXCH2 CPP flag), never via a data.pkg logical. An
# earlier version of this file incorrectly included useEXCH2=.TRUE.,
# which would have been an unrecognized namelist variable.
#
# useOASIM added: switches spectral surface
# irradiance from Steph's precomputed RT_EdFile/RT_EsFile binaries to
# pkg/oasim computing it dynamically at runtime from real atmospheric
# fields, matching ecco_darwin's own v06/1deg/input_darwin_v4r5_v2/data.pkg
# convention. See data.oasim (new file) and data.radtrans (RT_EdFile/
# RT_EsFile removed, RT_useOASIMrmud added). `oasim` and `sun` (already
# present) both need to be in packages.conf for this -- done in
# code_darwin_offline/packages.conf.
 &PACKAGES
 useGMRedi=.TRUE.
 usePTRACERS=.TRUE.
 useGCHEM=.TRUE.,
 useRADTRANS=.TRUE.,
 useOASIM=.TRUE.,
 useGGL90=.TRUE.,
 useMNC=.TRUE.,
 useEXF=.TRUE.,
 useCAL=.TRUE.,
 useOFFLINE=.TRUE.,
 useDIAGNOSTICS=.TRUE.,
 /
